# DUNE EXPRESS: mission 1 played through with the buttons alone: break the
# crate for a bullet, up the ladder, over the roofs, down the hatch behind
# the guard, open the strongbox and out to Biscuit.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 1
hold RIGHT 40
press B
wait 20
hold RIGHT 70
expect ammo == 2
expect tx == 10
hold UP 80
expect ty == 2
hold RIGHT 195
expect tx == 25
hold RIGHT A 50
expect ty == 2
expect tx >= 28
expect ground == 1
hold RIGHT 136
expect tx == 40
hold DOWN 80
expect ty == 6
expect phase == 0
hold RIGHT 10
press B
wait 40
hold LEFT 12
hold RIGHT 45
expect loot == 1
hold RIGHT 250
expect result == 1
expect kills == 0
expect state == 4
